---
// A three-step walkthrough using one precomputed, typical scan. No API call,
// no live model — the numbers here are illustrative and labelled as such.
// With JavaScript off the three steps render as a plain ordered list.
---

<div class="demo" id="demo">
  <div class="demo__head">
    <span class="demo__title">Your scan</span>
    <span class="demo__count" data-count>Step 1 of 3</span>
  </div>

  <ol class="demo__steps" data-steps>
    <li class="step" data-step="1" data-active>
      <span class="step__label"><span class="step__num">1</span> Photograph</span>
      <p class="h3 step__title">Take one photo in daylight.</p>
      <p>No filter, no makeup. One photo is enough to start.</p>
      <div class="step__photo">
        <img
          src="/images/tone-field.webp"
          width="1200"
          height="675"
          alt="A soft neutral reference gradient standing in for a skin photograph."
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <span class="step__tag">Sample photo</span>
      </div>
    </li>

    <li class="step" data-step="2">
      <span class="step__label"><span class="step__num">2</span> Read</span>
      <p class="h3 step__title">We read what the photo shows.</p>
      <p>Each reading carries how sure we are of it.</p>
      <ul class="readout">
        <li><b>Dryness</b> <span>moderate · 0.81</span></li>
        <li><b>Texture</b> <span>uneven · 0.74</span></li>
        <li><b>Evenness</b> <span>68 / 100 · 0.77</span></li>
      </ul>
    </li>

    <li class="step" data-step="3">
      <span class="step__label"><span class="step__num">3</span> Match</span>
      <p class="h3 step__title">You get a match, and the reason it fits.</p>
      <p>Never a score without its explanation.</p>
      <div class="match">
        <div class="match__top">
          <div class="match__thumb" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="match__name">Fragrance-free barrier cream</div>
            <div class="match__meta">Good match · 0.82 confidence</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="match__reason">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path
              d="m3 8.5 3 3 7-7"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.8"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            />
          </svg>
          Ceramides and glycerin, no fragrance — that suits the dryness and texture
          the scan found.
        </p>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <div class="demo__foot">
    <div class="demo__dots" aria-hidden="true">
      <span data-dot="1" data-on></span>
      <span data-dot="2"></span>
      <span data-dot="3"></span>
    </div>
    <button class="pill" type="button" data-next>
      <span data-next-label>Next step</span>
      <i aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
          <path
            d="M3 8h9M8.5 4.5 12 8l-3.5 3.5"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.6"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          />
        </svg>
      </i>
    </button>
  </div>

  <p class="demo__note">
    A sample scan, not a diagnosis. Photos are deleted within 24 hours unless you
    choose to keep them.
  </p>
</div>
